    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/763d25b033af1d2e4098a4c336689eb5.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are elite detectives who have arrived on an isolated island where something terrible has happened. In &quot;Mindwarp: AI Detective&quot;, time is your main adversary. Can you unravel the intricate web of lies and clues before the clock strikes midnight?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation Preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/6404808f6a12ed0fed9d038827e20fe5.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Team </strong>: In the menu, gather your team of detectives (play solo or team up with friends in co-op, or perhaps you'll want to compete with friends for the title of best detective!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario</strong>: Customize your game mode and set off for the island, receiving a brief introduction to the case.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/194511f10b467333dc46b4d5ed4e0574.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island World</strong>: Explore a picturesque yet mysterious island, filled with atmospheric locations and hidden corners.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living NPCs</strong>: Interact with the local residents \u2013 each has their own unique backstory, daily routine, and a host of secrets. Simply approach them and press a button to <strong>start a dialogue</strong>, ask questions, uncover contradictions, and gain valuable clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clue Hunting</strong>: Thoroughly search the map \u2013 from secret notes to suspicious objects, every piece of evidence brings you closer to solving the mystery. Collect them, analyze them, and piece them together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/536731223e98a6fd9921ee70ded157ac.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Time</strong>: You have only one in-game day to gather as much information as possible, interrogate all witnesses, and find key evidence. Time waits for no one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Making</strong>: Before dusk, you must deliver your verdict: who committed the crime and how? An incorrect decision will mean failure.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/763d25b033af1d2e4098a4c336689eb5.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your team are elite detectives who have arrived on an isolated island where something terrible has happened. In &quot;Mindwarp: AI Detective&quot;, time is your main adversary. Can you unravel the intricate web of lies and clues before the clock strikes midnight?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation Preparation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/6404808f6a12ed0fed9d038827e20fe5.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Team </strong>: In the menu, gather your team of detectives (play solo or team up with friends in co-op, or perhaps you'll want to compete with friends for the title of best detective!).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario</strong>: Customize your game mode and set off for the island, receiving a brief introduction to the case.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/194511f10b467333dc46b4d5ed4e0574.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island World</strong>: Explore a picturesque yet mysterious island, filled with atmospheric locations and hidden corners.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living NPCs</strong>: Interact with the local residents \u2013 each has their own unique backstory, daily routine, and a host of secrets. Simply approach them and press a button to <strong>start a dialogue</strong>, ask questions, uncover contradictions, and gain valuable clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clue Hunting</strong>: Thoroughly search the map \u2013 from secret notes to suspicious objects, every piece of evidence brings you closer to solving the mystery. Collect them, analyze them, and piece them together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305870/extras/536731223e98a6fd9921ee70ded157ac.avif?t=1755430343\" width=605 height=215 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Time</strong>: You have only one in-game day to gather as much information as possible, interrogate all witnesses, and find key evidence. Time waits for no one!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Making</strong>: Before dusk, you must deliver your verdict: who committed the crime and how? An incorrect decision will mean failure.</p></li></ul>",
